# This repository is deployed on GitHub Pages.
#
# GitHub Pages does not process Apache .htaccess files, so rules placed here are
# not enforced in production. Real protections for this site must come from:
# - HTML-level controls that the static site can emit, such as the CSP meta tag
# - _headers when deployed through a host/proxy that supports it, such as
#   Cloudflare Pages or Netlify
# - GitHub Pages / GitHub repository settings
# - A reverse proxy or CDN in front of the site if stronger response headers are needed
#
# Keep this file only as documentation to avoid a false sense of enforcement.
